{"id":"3296916b733e08cd","group":"93","path":"93/93-cor-birkhoff-subdirectly.md","title":"Birkhoff Subdirect Representation","display":"Birkhoff Subdirect Representation","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-cor-birkhoff-subdirectly","aliases":["93-cor-birkhoff-subdirectly"],"display":"Birkhoff Subdirect Representation","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-subdirect-product]]","[[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]]","[[93-thm-subdirect-representation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-cor-birkhoff-subdirectly"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-cor-birkhoff-subdirectly</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Birkhoff Subdirect Representation"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aa0a957ca4da4328\" href=\"?note=aa0a957ca4da4328\" title=\"93-df-subdirect-product\">93-df-subdirect-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"130ab752f509ade2\" href=\"?note=130ab752f509ade2\" title=\"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible\">93-df-subdirectly-irreducible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"730edd22d82070e5\" href=\"?note=730edd22d82070e5\" title=\"93-thm-subdirect-representation\">93-thm-subdirect-representation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"cor-birkhoff-subdirectly---Birkhoff-Subdirect-Representation\">cor-birkhoff-subdirectly - Birkhoff Subdirect Representation</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span> is nontrivial.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SI}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SI}_{93}\\)</span> are the predicates of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"aa0a957ca4da4328\" href=\"?note=aa0a957ca4da4328\" title=\"93-df-subdirect-product\">93-df-subdirect-product</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"130ab752f509ade2\" href=\"?note=130ab752f509ade2\" title=\"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible\">93-df-subdirectly-irreducible</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\bigl(\\exists a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(a\\ne b)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\exists I\\;\\exists\\mathbf B\\;\\exists e\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathbf B:I\\to V\\land\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}(e,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B;I,\\tau)\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{SI}_{93}(\\mathbf B(i))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\bigl(\\exists a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(a\\ne b)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\exists I\\;\\exists\\mathbf B\\;\\exists e\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathbf B:I\\to V\\land\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}(e,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B;I,\\tau)\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{SI}_{93}(\\mathbf B(i))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>With the book's convention that subdirectly irreducible algebras are nontrivial and subdirect products have a nonempty index set, the nontriviality antecedent is necessary.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"cor-birkhoff-subdirectly---Birkhoff-Subdirect-Representation","text":"cor-birkhoff-subdirectly - Birkhoff Subdirect Representation","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subdirect-product","status":"resolved","id":"aa0a957ca4da4328","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-subdirect-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible","status":"resolved","id":"130ab752f509ade2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-thm-subdirect-representation","status":"resolved","id":"730edd22d82070e5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-thm-subdirect-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subdirect-product","status":"resolved","id":"aa0a957ca4da4328","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{SI}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-subdirect-product]] and [[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subdirectly-irreducible","status":"resolved","id":"130ab752f509ade2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{SI}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-subdirect-product]] and [[93-df-subdirectly-irreducible]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SI}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\bigl(\\exists a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;(a\\ne b)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\to\\exists I\\;\\exists\\mathbf B\\;\\exists e\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathbf B:I\\to V\\land\\mathrm{SubdirEmb}_{93}(e,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B;I,\\tau)\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{SI}_{93}(\\mathbf B(i))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1220,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["6730349967b8ffce","aa0a957ca4da4328","130ab752f509ade2","730edd22d82070e5"]}